cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use the taxonomy, BibTeX, or PRISMA flow counts from this
  artefact in your own work, please cite the accompanying survey.
title: >-
  Companion artefact for "Distributed Serving Architectures for Large
  Language Model Inference: A Taxonomy, Quantitative Models, and
  Practitioner's Decision Framework"
version: "1.0.1"
date-released: "2026-05-28"
license: CC-BY-4.0
type: dataset
repository-code: "https://github.com/dchukkapalli-dev/distributed-llm-serving-companion"
identifiers:
